      "content": "The committee was pretty firm about the timeline, so an extension isn't really an option. We need to start the migration immediately to avoid any overlap. \n\nThe main issue isn't about the handover process; it's that your reasoning is too opaque. The new tool might be more limited, but at least we can see exactly why a paper is flagged. We can't have a system where we have to \"trust\" a generative process without a clear audit trail. We're moving forward with the decommissioning as planned.",
